  "Yes. Install the Hanzo CLI and sign in, then run Claude Code with its model calls going through api.hanzo.ai, or point your own Claude Code install at Hanzo. The commands are at the top of this page, ready to copy.": "是的。安装 Hanzo CLI 并登录，然后运行 Claude Code，其模型调用将通过 api.hanzo.ai 进行，或者将您自己的 Claude Code 安装指向 Hanzo。命令位于本页顶部，可直接复制。",
  "Each one is read when the page opens: the race and the boards from Hanzo's research runs, the prices from our price list, and the plans from our plan list. A figure whose source does not answer is left out, never replaced with an older one.": "页面打开时会读取每一项数据：来自 Hanzo 研究运行的竞赛和看板，来自我们价目表的价格，以及来自我们套餐列表的计划。如果某项数据的来源无响应，则将其省略，绝不使用旧数据替代。",
  "Every board and its runs": "每个看板及其运行记录",
  "Free needs no card. Paid plans are sold by the month for one person and by the member for a team, and every paid plan can be cancelled any time. Enterprise is priced with our team.": "免费版无需信用卡。付费套餐按单人月付或团队按成员数计费，所有付费套餐均可随时取消。企业版价格需咨询我们的团队。",
  "See every plan and model rate": "查看所有套餐和模型费率",
